# Golden G-M1-1: two-track polymeter (write gesture).
# drum: 4 steps (one hit on step 1) -> fires every 960 ticks.
# bass: 3 steps (hits on steps 1 and 3) -> wraps every 720 ticks.
# Two beats (1920 ticks) show the phase drift; NoteOffs pair each hit.
port open out synth
track new drum synth:10 drums
track new bass synth:3 bass
track length drum 4
track length bass 3
track step drum 1 C2 100 120
track step bass 1 C1 90 120
track step bass 3 G1 80 120
transport start
advance 1919
transport stop
quit
